Act as a professional spreadsheet expert and college timetable planner.

Create a well-organized college timetable in a clear table format.

Requirements:
1. Arrange the days of the week (Monday to Saturday) as rows.
2. Arrange the periods (Period 1 to Period 8) as columns.
3. Include the following details:
   - Subject names
   - Subject codes (if available)
   - Faculty names (if provided)
   - Break time
   - Lunch time
4. Maintain a proper and balanced subject distribution throughout the week.
5. Avoid repeating the same subject too frequently on a single day.
6. Make the timetable neat, professional, and easy to read.
7. Use different colours
